# API keys are NOT read from .env files (ADR 0007).
# Each key is a macOS login Keychain item named dsh-demo.<NAME>; the launchers
# in bin/ read them with `security find-generic-password -w` and export them
# only into the dsh process. Add one with (you are prompted for the value):
#
#   security add-generic-password -U -a "$USER" -s dsh-demo.OPENROUTER_API_KEY -w
#
# Keychain items:
#   dsh-demo.OPENROUTER_API_KEY
#   dsh-demo.OPENAI_API_KEY
#   dsh-demo.TAVILY_API_KEY
